13:T41d,Mix together butter and sugar until light and fluffy. Add egg yolks one at a time, setting aside the egg whites for the meringue. Add the flour mixed with baking powder. Stir in the milk, beating until smooth (you can use an electric mixer if you prefer). Preheat oven to 320°F (160°C). Cover a baking sheet with baking paper and spread out the batter into a large, even rectangle. Whisk together the egg whites and sugar until you get glossy, stiff peaks. The meringue should hold its form – if it still melts continue whisking. Spread out the meringue on top of the cake batter. Use a spatula to form light waves with the meringue. Sprinkle almonds on top of the meringue. Bake for about 30 minutes, until the meringue and almonds are golden. Incorporate 0.75 cup milk, 1 whole vanilla pod, 0.6666666666666666 cup butter, 0.75 cup granulated sugar, 5 pcs egg yolks, 1.25 cups flour, 1.5 tsp baking powder, 0.5 cup milk, 7 whole egg white, 1.5 cups granulated sugar, 1 sliced almonds, and 1.25 cups whipping cream smoothly until evenly distributed.11:["$","noscript",null,{"children":["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Kvæfjord Cake “Verdens Beste” (World’s Best Cake)"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Norway-inspired kvæfjord cake “verdens beste” (world’s best cake) with 16 measured ingredients — zero sign-up, instant Cook Mode. Ready in 45 mins (6 servings). 4.9★ rated with US/Metric scaling & hands-free Cook Mode."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Ingredients"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","0",{"children":"2 pcs Egg Yolks"}],["$","li","1",{"children":"2 tbsp Cornstarch"}],["$","li","2",{"children":"0.25 cup Granulated Sugar"}],["$","li","3",{"children":"0.6666666666666666 cup Heavy Cream"}],["$","li","4",{"children":"0.75 cup Milk"}],["$","li","5",{"children":"1 whole vanilla pod"}],["$","li","6",{"children":"0.6666666666666666 cup Butter"}],["$","li","7",{"children":"0.75 cup Granulated Sugar"}],["$","li","8",{"children":"5 pcs Egg Yolks"}],["